# The three homes an exception can have. The fixture holds Montréal signed
# out, one loan whose delivery failed, and one borrow the library never
# confirmed.
clean
tap Settings
wait-for Connection
wait-for Sign-in needed
expect --auth montreal
tap Library
wait-for My loans
wait-for Needs your attention
expect Uncertain fixture title
expect Check your library account
expect Fixture unsent title
expect Not sent to your reader
expect Return not confirmed
clean
tap Fixture unsent title
wait-for Needs you
expect both safe on your home
expect status 1
expect Send to my reader again
clean
tap Send to my reader again
wait-for My loans
clean
wait-for Sent to your reader
expect-missing Not sent to your reader
clean
